1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
SynKasa, live demo.
Watch it work before you pay.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
A front desk dashboard opens on Today, for a
worked example business with one owner.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
While the owner is with a client, nothing slips.
Three counters: leads caught, first reply, booked.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.800
A missed call arrives. The owner is busy,
and a text-back goes out on its own.

5
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.800
The lead inbox lists four leads with where each
came from, scored on intent, timing and value.

6
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.200
The highest scoring lead is a missed call.
A reply starts writing itself.

7
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.000
The reply goes out in the owner's own voice,
apologising for the missed call and offering the week.

8
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The customer answers and asks about Thursday.
A live booking link goes back to her.

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
She picks her own time on her own screen.
Nobody at the business has touched this yet.

10
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.400
The calendar now carries the booking.
Booked, caught, followed up, and confirmed.

11
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.460
Live in 7 days, or you don't pay.
